  },
  "guidedHint": "The Replication Lag may not pass 2 seconds. A small Read Replica applies 100 writes a second, but 176 arrive: it falls further behind every second. Use a medium Read Replica. Every part has its job: uploads straight to Object Storage, Read-your-writes to the primary database, jobs through the queue.",
